# PR product demos

For **complex features** or **user-facing behavioral changes**, ship a **product demo** on the cloud VM and **embed it in the PR** so Adrian can review without a checkout. **No mandatory BDD verifier** — record a good clip, sync the PR body, hand off in **Draft**.

## When “complex” applies

Any of:

- New or changed user flow (commands, modals, settings, status, errors, permissions)
- **Large change heuristic:** ≥3 non-test files under `src/ui/`, `src/hooks/`, plugin settings tab, or `styles.css`
- Any user-facing `[Unreleased]` changelog bullet for behavior or UI

## Required evidence

- Record or capture on the **Cursor Cloud VM** (not local-only proof when cloud is available).
- Attach walkthrough media to the PR so reviewers can validate without a checkout:
  - **Screen recording (`.mp4`)** — **required** for complex features and user-facing flows (multi-step interaction, animation, modal/settings/status changes). **Screenshots-only is not enough** for those PRs.
  - **Screenshots** — sufficient only for **static** layout/copy proof with no interaction story (still pair with CLI/eval when behavior changed).
  - Artifacts must be **embedded in the PR description** (inline video/images), not only on the agent run dashboard or in chat.
- Under each video, add **### What to look for** with **3–5 bullets** — each bullet is one observable proof point from the demo.
- During the recording or live walkthrough, run the **UI jank pass** in [obsidian-visual-verify](../../skills/obsidian-visual-verify/SKILL.md) and [ux-design](../../skills/ux-design/SKILL.md) — fail the demo if jank is ship-blocking.
- Use git-ignored paths (`.tmp/`, `/opt/cursor/artifacts/` on cloud) for capture files; never commit demo binaries.
- **Pacing:** Move quickly between steps; **pause briefly on key UX moments** so proof is readable (glyph, menu item, tab content, reload restore, etc.) — see [obsidian-agent-ui-demo](../../skills/obsidian-agent-ui-demo/SKILL.md). Do not skip through evidence frames.
- **Agent execution:** Task → **`ui-demo-agent`** (**`composer-2.5-fast`**) per [obsidian-agent-ui-demo](../../skills/obsidian-agent-ui-demo/SKILL.md) — script and preflight off camera; one short proof clip.
- Run [obsidian-ui-visibility](../../skills/obsidian-ui-visibility/SKILL.md) before capture. A demo where Settings or a modal covers the feature is not review-ready.

## How to attach

Follow [obsidian-cloud-vm-demos](../../skills/obsidian-cloud-vm-demos/SKILL.md). Prefer **`ManagePullRequest` `update_pr`** to refresh the PR **body** with embedded `/opt/cursor/artifacts/` media. Manual fallback: `gh pr edit --body-file … --attach ./demo.mp4`.

After media is captured, run [obsidian-pr-ship-sync](../../skills/obsidian-pr-ship-sync/SKILL.md) so title, description, and embeds match the latest clip. **Keep the PR Draft** until Adrian (or the user) marks **Ready for review** — see [pr-draft-ready](./pr-draft-ready.mdc).

Optional: **`/pr-acceptance-review`** ([obsidian-pr-acceptance-review](../../skills/obsidian-pr-acceptance-review/SKILL.md)) for a structured **`## Acceptance review`** block — not required for human handoff.

## When it can be skipped

Local-only request, zero UI/behavior impact, or cloud demo blocked (env/secrets) — say what was verified instead.
